Mxv2jwK-U\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X0S8Js2UKPY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span color=\"#ff2a00\" style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><span style=\"caret-color: #ff2a00; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><b></b></span></span><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8CAeSIoOrUVaN8Kg3vN9lAJ-CxJm4rmbENyRfa835jDiri5bkkM7jqt0RkEqiS_MrPl8h_3zWjO_Kzz_NP-nfUiBIhyDbiC6jau7JmJBBTB8L_c3BU7i0Nlv285XqSrtkK7DX6bMSfHX1DpHgutaSES=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"></strong></span></p>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AJFCJaXU-0nDz0rnZoraDvR2w_i0S6FPNSokNQm8KUgzNerGm79kOyh3H9Vft3oS6U9OuN67k5NZZgCiEHp9gL7zzpsjHffeHyEBbnht4wJDPArUKD6crBA4AatvNcyA49S3jRDtw0B5an9udGo7c_9THOXj=w1720-h1147-s-no?authuser=1\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AJFCJaXU-0nDz0rnZoraDvR2w_i0S6FPNSokNQm8KUgzNerGm79kOyh3H9Vft3oS6U9OuN67k5NZZgCiEHp9gL7zzpsjHffeHyEBbnht4wJDPArUKD6crBA4AatvNcyA49S3jRDtw0B5an9udGo7c_9THOXj=w1720-h1147-s-no?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AMWts8AfGzSD8M1gsqveqyTNEteTuGYj9mSFaelx12QOYfn3X_TKEXGdC50bZdMNJpNjhtK9cD4iLxOe_vTUrJzsMiUQNFu07hyOjkjZ7vVKDRYjG2pwvUurYu9Xa_4gD1OrGHjvW7SuTq83IO-nL7rtFfKr=w1360-h907-no?authuser=2\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HgMMboGdDNg\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n<h1>SPECIFICATIONS</h1>\n<p>Supporting Language: English</p>\n<p>Screen Type: <strong>IPS Display</strong></p>\n<p>Screen Resolution: 640x480</p>\n<p>Recommended age: Over 8 years Old</p>\n<p>Package: Yes</p>\n<p>Operating System: Linux</p>\n<p>Material: Plastic</p>\n<p>Input/Output: HDMI</p>\n<p>HDMI: Standard HDMI</p>\n<p>Games included: 5474</p>\n<p>Games Type: Retro Game</p>\n<p>External Controller Interface: Type-C</p>\n<p>Expandable storage: Up to 512GB</p>\n<p>Display Size: 3.5\"</p>\n<p>Data Storage Capacity: 64G</p>\n<p>Communication: USB</p>\n<p>Color Display: Yes</p>\n<p>Charging Interface Type: Micro USB</p>\n<p>Certification: WEEE, CE</p>\n<p>Category: Handheld Game Players</p>\n<p>Brand Name: Anbernic</p>\n<p>Bluetooth-compatible, Wifi : NO</p>\n<p>Battery Capacity[mAh]: 2600</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; height: 453px; width: 562.52pt;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Color</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Transparent white</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Screen</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>3.5-inch IPS full viewing angle, OCA full lamination/ 640*480</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>CPU</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>quad-core ARM Cortex-A9</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>GPU</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Quad-core PowerVR SGX544MP GPU</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>RAM</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>DDR3 256MB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Storage</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>64GB TF/MicroSD</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>System</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Linux</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 62; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Games</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 62; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Support: PS1,CPS,FBA,NEOGEO,GBA,GBC,GB,SFC,FC,MAME,MD,GG,<br> PCE,NGPC,SMS,WSC and other formats of the game.<br> Support users to download games in relevant formats</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 33; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Language</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 33; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>English</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Speaker</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>High-fidelity speaker</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>TF card</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Dual card slots, support TF card expansion, maximum 512GB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Battery</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Li-polymer battery 2100 mAh, lasting 5 hours</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Charging</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>5V/1.5A, support C2C charger</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 36; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Other function</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 36; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>Support 2.4G wireless gamepad and wired gamepad connection, HDMI output TV, vibrating motor</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"height: 26; width: 107.25pt;\">\n<p>Accessories</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"height: 26; width: 455.25pt;\">\n<p>USB charging cable, 